"Substitute for Brains" that sits on the player's shoulder and, in times
of crisis, screams helpful messages in the player's ear, like oh, say,
for a random set that would have been helpful a few minutes ago:

"This isn't a real-time game, stop and think, you idiot!"

"You don't stand your ground to fight a killer bee with lousy armor
class and only a handful of max hit points!"

"You're cornered and about to die; is there some useful thing you could
do with that wand of teleport in your pack, like, say, zap yourself or
the bee?"

"You're almost out of hit points, I'll bet your god hasn't heard from
you in a really long while, why not phone home?"

"Potions of healing are good for something besides diluting to make holy
water, you know!"

